  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/24d40aa119202dd62d62c111ccdfa91936e05700.png\" alt=\"Better Keys 標題\"></p><h2><strong>讓試煉之鑰擁有全新的造型與視覺效果，使其更加迷人、獨特且帶有神秘的氛圍，靈感來自於經典 Origin Realms 的寶箱鑰匙設計（感謝他們的啟發）</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db4467dc6ef27c2d01bb4da32f6eff9834315c0d.png\" alt=\"鑰匙\">&nbsp;同時也相容於&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fdungeons-and-taverns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons And Taverns</a></p><p>查看我的其他資源包：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252famoozing-cows\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Amoozing COWS（超讚乳牛）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcluckin-chicks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cluckin' CHICKS（咯咯小雞）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-bats\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Better BATS（更棒蝙蝠）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmob-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>MOB Items（生物道具）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fenchantrax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>ENCHANTRAX（附魔之斧）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-keys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Better Keys（更棒鑰匙）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252firidescent-star\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Iridescent Star（彩虹之星）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgolem-toys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Golem Toys（魔像玩具）</strong></a></li>\n</ul><h4>• 本資源包由&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fMarkiS_arts\" rel=\"nofollow\">itsMarkiS • @Markis_Art